@baseUrl=http://localhost:3000
@apiKey=YOUR_AUTOMATION_API_KEY


### 1) Preview (nothing is created, no auth) - this week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/versions/next-release?major=9

### 2) Preview - given date + minor, one month ahead
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/versions/next-release?major=9&minor=1&date=2026-11-13&monthOffset=1&projectId=858

### 3) Create - no key (expect 401/403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/release/next-release
Content-Type: application/json

{ "major": 9 }

### 4) Create - Redmine Version only, no Jenkins Version Folder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/release/next-release
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{ "major": 9, "minor": 0, "date": "2026-11-13", "projectId": 858, "createJenkinsFolder": false }

### 5) Create - Redmine Version + Jenkins Version Folder ("" = default Script Branch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/release/next-release
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{ "major": 9, "projectId": 858, "scriptBranch": "", "createJenkinsFolder": true, "cleanup": true }

### 6) Poll the Jenkins job (jobId from the response of #5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jenkins/version-folder/REPLACE_WITH_JOB_ID

### 7) Validation error (major missing, monthOffset out of range) - expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/release/next-release
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{ "monthOffset": 99 }
